    "Shared representation is 2D paths. Source command indices are local to one capture, not stable cross-revision vertex identities.",
    "The existing low-level flattener still requires valid input/finite positive tolerance and keeps its 256-chord cap; certified adaptive error bounds, generated-vertex provenance and quality adaptation are unfinished.",
